# cmuxterm tool state, created by the terminal multiplexer in the repo root
~/
# A developer-global ignore may carry a bare `.claude`, which prunes the whole
# directory before any negation below it is read. Un-ignore the directory first,
# then ignore its contents: settings.json carries this machine's absolute path
# and stays local, while settings.json.example is what docs/workflow.md tells
# people to copy, so it must be tracked.
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json.example
